RISCV SB+fence.tso
"RISC-V's fence.tso orders R->R, R->W and W->W but NOT store->load, so SB+fence.tso
 is allowed on RVWMO. ARMv8 has no single instruction with exactly TSO-fence
 semantics. On the common instruction set herd's aarch64.cat and riscv.cat
 coincide on every test we swept (see README); the separation is instruction-level."
{ 0:x10=x; 0:x12=y; 1:x10=y; 1:x12=x; }
 P0              | P1              ;
 ori x11,x0,1   | ori x11,x0,1    ;
 sw x11,0(x10)  | sw x11,0(x10)   ;
 fence.tso      | fence.tso       ;
 lw x13,0(x12)  | lw x13,0(x12)   ;
exists (0:x13=0 /\ 1:x13=0)
